in this video i'm gonna explain what you  can expect to see  in attack on titan season four and we're  going to be doing this without giving  away  any spoilers you may think that sounds  impossible but  what i'm gonna do is give a very generic  overview of the things we can expect  without going into any spoilery details  season 4 is of course going to be the  final season of attack on titan  so be sure to hit that sub button as i  will be doing more videos as the season  goes on  okay so as you probably guessed from the  trailer attack on titan season 4 will  introduce us to  a whole new cast of characters from the  outside world we found out in season 3  that humanity was not exclusively  confined to the walls as  as we previously believed and yeah  everyone outside the walls  pretty much hates everyone inside the  walls the nation of mali  is where most of the new characters will  be coming from and season four will show  you how the people living there  have been indoctrinated to believe that  you know all the people on the island  are just  devils as we found out in season three  people on the island are part of the  eldian race which is why they are able  to turn into titans  whereas normal people cannot turn into  titans so that's pretty much the main  distinction between  aldeans and regular people during season  4 we'll get to see how eldians  outside of the island are being treated  around the world  and we'll also see how eldians are used  by the nation of mali  the mali storyline will give us proper  backstories for characters we already  know  which will really enhance our  understanding of why they acted the way  they did  in seasons two and three also the  motivations of certain new characters  will become  very understandable but that probably  won't stop you from hating them but you  know  you'll understand their point of view  along the way we'll discover the truth  about the great titan war  that caused the aldians to be trapped  behind the walls in the first place  and will also see the ninth and final  titan shifter  this was briefly shown in the trailers  and i won't say the name  but the mystery surrounding who has that  titan will will be very interesting  something else you'll notice from the  trailer is that eren mikasa armin and  pretty much everyone else  they all look older and that's because  they are there has been a time skip  during the time that has passed between  seasons three and four  the eldians on the island have learnt  certain things that have changed erin's  perspective on who should live or die  in my opinion i think season 4 eren will  be the best aaron we've seen  because he's just way cooler and he  makes way more calculated decisions  than he's ever done before the origin of  the titans themselves will also be  explained  as we'll finally get the truth as to how  they exist in the first place  on top of that new titan abilities will  be seen for the first time  even for titans that we've already seen  before so they'll be doing new things  that we didn't know they could do  aaron's connection to another character  in this series will be a crucial factor  in the decisions that everyone makes  and as the season progresses will be  really interesting for us to kind of  figure out who is telling the truth  beyond being a show about titans season  4 is equally a series about politics  as we see the politics of the island and  the politics of the outside world  being big factors in decisions that  people make these political  disagreements are based on  self-preservation revenge racism  and a lack of trust that will ultimately  decide the fate of humanity  as much as i would like to say more i  feel that that is enough for this  overview of what to expect but let me  know if you want to see  more attack on titan videos in the  comments thanks for watching and  until the next one peace out
 

